GARUDA changes to axi_spi_master's SPI datapath (D-22, zero-waiver F4, recorded 2026-11-19).
- F4 renames (d995a4a): clock and reset ports to pclk/preset_n; spi_master_clkgen ->
  spim_clkgen and spi_master_controller -> spim_ctrl (HAL module-name length), files with them.
- F4 style (a7c8db1): tools/rtl_style.py; proven equivalent by JasperGold SEC. No logic change.
- SPIM-6 (2026-11-21, G6 6.4): spim_ctrl raises eot when a transfer ends after the command or the
  address with no data phase (a bare command such as WREN, or command + address); upstream went
  back to IDLE silently, so IRQSTAT[0] never set and firmware following SPIM [N-6.1a] waited forever.

